{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40554","headline":"夏日即事 · 裴说","name":"夏日即事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"僻居门巷静，竟日坐阶墀。\n鹊喜虽传信，蛩吟不见诗。\n笋抽通旧竹，梅落立闲枝。\n此际无尘挠，僧来称所宜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40554.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40554","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}